y over the church but failed to do so on the nobility, he offended the nobles and was thereby forced to accept a charter (Håndfæstning) which limited his authority while confirming the rights of the nobles.","wp_description":"King of Denmark from 1259 to 1286","wikipedia_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eric_V_of_Denmark","image_lead":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/Erik_Glipping.jpg","thumbnail":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/Erik_Glipping.jpg","chat_ready":true,"display_from":1259,"display_to":1286}